---
description: MOMO Sentinel non-negotiable engineering and safety rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow RULES.md at the repo root. Summary:

- Policy/threshold decisions are pure Python in backend/app/policy; no LLM/HTTP imports there.
- Raw free text (memos, names, device labels, KYC notes, tool output) never enters an investigator prompt; only typed MemoFacts do.
- The LLM has no block/release/file/commit capability; it may only make a route stricter. Strictest route wins: PENDING_APPROVAL > NEEDS_REVIEW > AUTO_CLEAR.
- Fail closed: any LLM/tool failure routes to NEEDS_REVIEW or stricter.
- Model names only from env: GROQ_MODEL_MAIN, GROQ_MODEL_LIGHT, GROQ_MODEL_GUARD.
- All LLM calls go through the cache; DEMO_MODE=replay serves cache only. Tests never hit the network.
- Never weaken tests. No new dependencies without approval (docs/DEPENDENCIES.md). Never commit secrets.
- Synthetic data and fictional watchlist names only.
- Small steps, run and test each, commit per step.
